      "printed_type": "@G4.AlgebraicProfile.finite_response_equations : ∀ {K : Type u_1} {L : Type u_2} {σ : Type u_3} {ι : Type u_4}\n  [inst : CommRing K] [IsNoetherianRing K] [inst_2 : CommRing L] [Finite σ] (P : ι → MvPolynomial σ K) (a : ι → K)\n  (coeff : K →+* L),\n  ∃ J,\n    ∀ (η : σ → L),\n      (∀ (i : ι), (MvPolynomial.eval₂Hom coeff η) (P i) = coeff (a i)) ↔\n        ∀ i ∈ J, (MvPolynomial.eval₂Hom coeff η) (P i) = coeff (a i)"
